# {{ service_name }}

`{{ service_name }}` (`{{ service_slug }}`) is a generated PokerLost FastAPI service foundation.
It contains reusable infrastructure and no business implementation.

Before development, read [`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md), [`SERVICE.md`](SERVICE.md), and
[`docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`](docs/ARCHITECTURE.md). Fill `SERVICE.md` `TODO` sections only with known
service facts.

## Install and configure

```bash
cp .env.example .env
uv lock
uv sync --locked
```

Replace local placeholders in `.env`; never commit credentials. Settings use the
`{{ service_env_prefix }}_` prefix and `__` between nested groups. A complete
`postgresql+asyncpg` URL is required, for example through:

```text
{{ service_env_prefix }}_DATABASE__URL
```

PostgreSQL is not started by the application, and migrations do not run at startup.

## Run

```bash
make run
```

For the production Gunicorn/Uvicorn worker process:

```bash
make serve
```

The ASGI factory is `api.application:create_app`; there is no module-level FastAPI instance.

## Base endpoints

| method | path | operation_id | response_model |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `GET` | `/` | `{{ service_name }}.root` | `RootResponse` |
| `GET` | `/openapi.get` | `{{ service_name }}.openapi.get` | `OpenApiResponse` |

Both response models use the `ApplicationResponse` envelope. Built-in `/openapi.json`, `/docs`, and
`/redoc` are disabled.

## Database migrations

The scaffold starts with common SQLAlchemy metadata and no fake baseline revision or business
table.

```bash
make db-upgrade
make db-downgrade
make db-revision message=add_feature_table
```

## Quality checks

```bash
uv lock --check
make format
make lint
make typecheck
make pre-commit
python -m compileall -q app alembic/env.py
git diff --check
```

## Docker and Helm

Build after creating `uv.lock`:

```bash
docker build -t {{ service_slug }} .
```

The Helm chart is under `deploy/helm/{{ service_slug }}/`. Database credentials must come from the
configured Kubernetes Secret reference.
